  debateWarnText: "<p>These questions are made for debate: opinions will differ, and it can heat up.</p><p><b>Do you all agree?</b> By turning them on, you agree that:</p><ul><li>everyone at the table is up for it;</li><li>we debate ideas, never people: no mocking, no judging;</li><li>anyone can pass a question or end the debate at any time, without explaining why.</li></ul>",
